==Restrictions==
Unit Restriction: Only [[Shin Japan Heroes Universe Collaboration Event|Shin Japan Heroes Universe]] Units

==Battleground==
*1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns.
*1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>.
*1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns after 24 seconds<sup>720f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Angelic Gory]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
[[Evangelion Cat (Rare Cat)|Evangelion Cat]] is enough to solo this stage at a high enough level, only needing to deal with a trio of Heavenly Hippoe and a single Angelic Gory when the enemy base is hit. These enemies are spread out far enough for Evangelion Cat's single target to not even matter. As usual, [[Cat Combo]]s can help if needed.

